Third-party components (NOT committed; obtained at runtime)
-----------------------------------------------------------
6. Fusion Pixel Font - https://github.com/TakWolf/fusion-pixel-font
   Copyright (c) TakWolf
   Licensed under the MIT License.
   NOT distributed with this repository. The font is downloaded onto the user's
   own computer at runtime by `ui/cjk.lua`, because the 8px font is 1,681,325
   bytes and a default CC:Tweaked computer's disk limit is 1,000,000 bytes, so
   the font cannot be stored alongside the program on a default server. This is
   the same approach MPlayer takes.

